                                "sense_id": "0de05873-a0bb-39cc-902a-0e47dee56d08",
                                "text": "Reflexology is based on the idea that different points on the feet correlate to different points in the body and by gentle massage of the feet one can heal the body, unblock energy and ease stress."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
